{
  "id": "brilliant-stars-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Brilliant Stars Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "The first Build & Battle Box with a ready-to-play 40-card deck: 17 basic Energy cards joined the 23 cards of earlier boxes. Shops in the Prerelease Program sold the boxes from 12 February 2022, and unofficial prerelease events were held that weekend and the next. Each box held four Brilliant Stars booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Brilliant Stars logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Torterra, Moltres, Infernape, Lucario, Bibarel and Professor's Research, which booster packs have only in holofoil; the Professor's Research came again in later boxes.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Sword & Shield TCG Series merchandise, Brilliant Stars Build & Battle Box",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Sword_%26_Shield_TCG_Series_merchandise#Brilliant_Stars_Build_%26_Battle_Box"
      },
      {
